    {
      "schema_version": 6,
      "book_id": "2JN",
      "chapter": 1,
      "chapter_usfm": "2JN.1",
      "version_id": 100,
      "version_abbr": "NASB1995",
      "verses": [
        {
          "verse": 1,
          "usfm": "2JN.1.1",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "The elder to the chosen lady and her children, whom I love in truth; and not only I, but also all who know the truth,"
        },
        {
          "verse": 2,
          "usfm": "2JN.1.2",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "for the sake of the truth which abides in us and will be with us forever:"
        },
        {
          "verse": 3,
          "usfm": "2JN.1.3",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "Grace, mercy and peace will be with us, from God the Father and from Jesus Christ, the Son of the Father, in truth and love."
        },
        {
          "verse": 4,
          "usfm": "2JN.1.4",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "I was very glad to find some of your children walking in truth, just as we have received commandment to do from the Father."
        },
        {
          "verse": 5,
          "usfm": "2JN.1.5",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "Now I ask you, lady, not as though I were writing to you a new commandment, but the one which we have had from the beginning, that we love one another."
        },
        {
          "verse": 6,
          "usfm": "2JN.1.6",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "And this is love, that we walk according to His commandments. This is the commandment, just as you have heard from the beginning, that you should walk in it."
        },
        {
          "verse": 7,
          "usfm": "2JN.1.7",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "For many deceivers have gone out into the world, those who do not acknowledge Jesus Christ as coming in the flesh. This is the deceiver and the antichrist."
        },
        {
          "verse": 8,
          "usfm": "2JN.1.8",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "Watch yourselves, that you do not lose what we have accomplished, but that you may receive a full reward."
        },
        {
          "verse": 9,
          "usfm": "2JN.1.9",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "Anyone who goes too far and does not abide in the teaching of Christ, does not have God; the one who abides in the teaching, he has both the Father and the Son."
        },
        {
          "verse": 10,
          "usfm": "2JN.1.10",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "If anyone comes to you and does not bring this teaching, do not receive him into your house, and do not give him a greeting;"
        },
        {
          "verse": 11,
          "usfm": "2JN.1.11",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "for the one who gives him a greeting participates in his evil deeds."
        },
        {
          "verse": 12,
          "usfm": "2JN.1.12",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "Though I have many things to write to you, I do not want to do so with paper and ink; but I hope to come to you and speak face to face, so that your joy may be made full."
        },
        {
          "verse": 13,
          "usfm": "2JN.1.13",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "The children of your chosen sister greet you."
        }
      ],
